        "text": "Donald P. (Don) Wagner is an Orange County supervisor, a former Irvine mayor, and a former state assemblymember. He is a practicing attorney and founded the Orange County chapter of the Federalist Society, a national organization of conservative lawyers, judges, and law professors.",
